todo:
Usually, dir structure is like:
<workspace_name>
        |-- build/
        |-- install/
        |-- log/
        |-- src/
              |-- <package_name>/
                        |-- config/
                        |-- launch/
                        |-- src/
                        |-- models/
                        |-- worlds/
                        |-- package.xml
                        |-- setup.py
                        |-- [etc]

but currently, ours looks like:
<workspace_name>
        |-- build/
        |-- install/
        |-- log/
        |-- src/
              |-- uq-in-slam/
                        |-- uqslam/
                               |-- launch/
                               |-- src/
                               |-- models/
                               |-- worlds/
                               |-- package.xml
                               |-- setup.py
                               |-- [etc]

The extra directory level `uq-in-slam/` adds unnecessary nesting and should be removed so that `uqslam/` lives directly under `src/`.